{"id": "436267", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות משותפת גאומטרית – חישוב E[XY] או E[X]E[Y]", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהיו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X,Y \\)</span> שני משתנים מקריים וידוע שלכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( 1\\leq m&lt;k \\)</span> מתקיים:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle{\\mathbb{P}(X=k, Y=m)={{CT:0}}\\cdot\\left( {{CT:1}} \\right)^{k-2}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( {{CT:2}} \\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מפרקים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X=Y+W\\)</span> ומראים ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> גאומטריים ובלתי תלויים; ואז מחשבים בעזרת לינאריות התוחלת.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פירוק X = Y + W</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W=X-Y\\)</span>. לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m\\ge1\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(j\\ge 1\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[Y=m,\\ W=j]=\\mathbb{P}[X=m+j,\\ Y=m]={{CT:0}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{m+j-2}={{CT:3}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{m-1}\\cdot {{CT:3}}\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)^{j-1} \\]</p>פונקציית ההסתברות המשותפת היא מכפלה, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span> בלתי תלויים, ושניהם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathrm{Geo}(p)\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p={{CT:3}}\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[Y]=\\mathbb{E}[W]=\\frac1p={{CT:4}},\\qquad \\mathsf{Var}[Y]=\\frac{1-p}{p^2}={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — החישוב</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:10}}\"]]לפי לינאריות התוחלת ואי-התלות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y,W\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[XY]=\\mathbb{E}[Y^2]+\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\,\\mathbb{E}[W]=\\left(\\mathsf{Var}[Y]+\\mathbb{E}[Y]^2\\right)+\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\,\\mathbb{E}[W]={{CT:5}}+{{CT:6}}+{{CT:6}} \\]</p>שימו לב: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y\\)</span> תלויים, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[XY]\\)</span> שונה מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\,\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\)</span>.<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[XY]={{CT:7}} \\]</p>[[else]]לפי לינאריות התוחלת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[X]=\\mathbb{E}[Y]+\\mathbb{E}[W]={{CT:8}}\\)</span>, ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{E}[X]\\,\\mathbb{E}[Y]={{CT:8}}\\cdot {{CT:4}}={{CT:9}} \\]</p>[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "if q=1 then 2/p^2 else -1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p>חישבתם \\(\\mathbb{E}[X]\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\). המשתנים \\(X\\) ו-\\(Y\\) תלויים, ולכן \\(\\mathbb{E}[XY]\\neq\\mathbb{E}[X]\\mathbb{E}[Y]\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "p", "q", "q1", "q2", "qu", "ta", "tmp"], "nvariants": 20}